<div class="container">
    {% set photo = images["/img/photo.png"] %}
    <img class="photo" src="{{ photo.src }}" srcset="{{ photo.srcset }}" sizes="280px" width="{{ photo.width }}"
        height="{{ photo.height }}" alt="Portrait photo of me">

    {% include "contact-links.njk" %}

    <div class="intro">
        <p>
            Hello! My name is <b>Mikołaj Wójcik</b> and I’m a <b>game programmer</b> with {{ year - site.careerStartYear }} years of commercial
            experience. My main focus is gameplay programming: building responsive character controllers, fluid
            movement, expressive animation, intuitive UI, and high-impact shaders & effects that make the game feel
            great to play.
        </p>
        <p>
            I also love to create all kinds of other, non-game, things.
        </p>
        <p>
            Feel free to explore some of the projects that I had a chance to work on in the <b>"works"</b> page.
        </p>
        <p>
            I made some plugins for UE while working on my side projects. You're free to use them and check their code
            out on <a href="https://github.com/miknios?tab=repositories" target="_blank">GitHub</a>, but sadly I don't
            have enough time to make documentation for how you use them exactly.
        </p>
        <p>
            For more about my working experience, education and skills, take a look at my
            <a href="{{ contact.cv }}" target="_blank">CV</a>.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
